    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-city-of-st.-charles-mo</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Permanent ban — data centers removed as a permitted use from all zoning districts, 7-1 (Bill 14085). Triggered by &#x27;Project Cumulus&#x27; proposal near city water wells. Initial 1-year moratorium Aug 2025</description>
  </item>
